## Prep
- [ ] Pesquisar escritorio
- [ ] Preparar deck
- [ ] Definir proposta de valor

---
*Criado automaticamente pelo CRM*",
  "status": "to do",
  "priority": 1,
  "due_date": {{ Date.now() + 48 * 60 * 60 * 1000 }},
  "tags": ["outbound", "meeting", "auto-created"]
}

={
  "name": "Proposta: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }} ({{ $json.company_name || 'N/A' }})",
